==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɹɛdʒ.ɪsˌtɹɑɹ/|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|registrārius}}, from {{m|la|registrum||register}} + {{m|la|-ārius||agent}}. See more at {{term|register}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[official]] [[keeper]], or [[recorder]] of [[record]]s.
# An [[officer]] in a [[university]] who keeps [[enrollment]] and [[academic]] [[achievement]] records.
# An officer in a [[hospital]] who records [[admission]]s.
# {{context|Internet|lang=en}} a [[service]] that [[manage]]s [[domain name]]s.

====Related terms====
* [[register]], [[registry]]

